    "images_with_text_scroll_3Nqkmi": {
      "type": "images-with-text-scroll",
      "blocks": {
        "image_with_text_rXJ4dc": {
          "type": "image_with_text",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "",
            "title": "Nothing is random.",
            "content": "<p>Beneath every choice, behind every encounter, ther's a frequency an invisible rhythm shaping our lives, guiding us toward meaning. you recognise that sensation, that connection to something bigger a moment when the rhythm of the universe connects to you.</p>",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_style": "solid"
          }
        },
        "image_with_text_9YLRjh": {
          "type": "image_with_text",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "",
            "title": "At Annoory, we give form to that feeling",
            "content": "<p>Use this text to share information about your brand with your customers. Describe a product, share announcements, or welcome customers to your store.</p>",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_style": "solid"
          }
        },
        "image_with_text_3X97yR": {
          "type": "image_with_text",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "",
            "title": "",
            "content": "<p>Created by Elinor Avni and Anna Cohen, Annoory reflects the harmony of form and intention Elinor's refined designs infused with Anna's deep understanding of energy and manifestation. More than adornment, these pieces are channels for good energy, Opening the pathways to whats always been yours</p>",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_style": "solid"
          }
        },
        "image_with_text_4kMLEt": {
          "type": "image_with_text",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "",
            "title": "Elinor Avni.",
            "content": "<p>Known for her creative mastery and architectural precision, Elinor's innovative work at AME and Noritamy has garnered international acclaim over the past 18 years. Her jewelry designs have graced the pages of leading fashion publications including Vogue, Elle, and Harper’s Bazaar, and has adorned members of Hollywood’s elite. Merging modern form with timeless elegance, her pieces </p><p>speak through structure and texture. Elinor has collaborated with brands such as Samsung, Chivas Regal, and Converse. Her designs have been featured in WGSN trend reports, Swarovski’s Book of Inspirations, and The Business of Fashion (BOF). She is a proud recipient of two  design awards.</p>",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_style": "solid"
          }
        },
        "image_with_text_g8nTVa": {
          "type": "image_with_text",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "",
            "title": "Anna Cohen.",
            "content": "<p>Rooted in personal transformation and the power of frequency and structure, Anna brings a unique </p><p>multidimensional lens combining a high fashion and jewelry background with over a decade of experience in personal development and mindset coaching. Anna is a mentor, international speaker educator and author. Her expansive global clientele are a testimony to her ability to open doorways of consciousness for others and facilitate powerful progressions and life changing experiences. </p><p>Anna's approach blends a a deep gift of intuition with strategy, a bridge for bringing higher wisdom into pragmatic practice and evolution. offering a practical framework, for living and leading with empowerment, vibrance and optimization across mind, body, and soul as a unified one</p>",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_style": "solid"
          }
        },
        "image_with_text_bf3zEF": {
          "type": "image_with_text",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "",
            "title": "",
            "content": "<p>Annoory is the creation of Elinor Avni, a world-renowned designer and master of form, and Anna Cohen, a global spiritual mentor in energetics and wellness a seer of energies. Together, they fuse design and intuition to create jewelry that resonates beyond beauty. This is more than adornment. it's a unification of power and aesthetics.  A consistent pattern that tunes you into the heartbeat of creation, designed to lead you exactly where you need to be. All you have to do is align with it. Annoory. Good things come to those who wear.</p>",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_style": "solid"
          }
        }
      },
